    "title": "Laura Dahlmeier, 2-Time Olympic Biathlon Winner, Dies in Mountaineering Accident | NTD",
    "text": "Laura Dahlmeier, 31, died in a mountaineering accident in Pakistan, according to local government authorities. The accident occurred on Monday as she was struck by a rockfall. Dahlmeier won gold in both the women's Biathlon sprint and pursuit events in the 2018 Winter Games.\nLaura Dahlmeier, 2-Time Olympic Biathlon Winner, Dies in Mountaineering Accident\nLaura Dahlmeier, 31, died in a mountaineering accident in Pakistan.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 7/30/2025, 11:00:13 PM EDT",
